  "description": "*“But why does Executive Director Alpine look like that?”*\n\nAlthough he is the illegitimate child of a chaebol family, Hee-Seo, who has manifested as a dominant Alpha, has taken charge of her family’s major business. One day, by chance, he meets Jae-Won, the director of the Genetic Research Institute. Jae-Won comes across as inexplicably cocky, but from their very first meeting, he feels a strange connection…\n\nThen one day, Hee-Seo begins to exhibit strange symptoms.\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
